  (2834781358, 'AUSTUFF Swivel Bar Stools Set of 2 Velvet Barstools for Kitchen Island (30", Blue)', '👍【360-degree Swivel Function】This barstool is Finished with a convenient and smooth 360-degree swivel function, which can enable you and your guests to rotate in any direction effortlessly when communicating, making dining and socializing easier. 👍【Vintage Design】Bar stools for kitchen island offer a sophisticated design, which is refined with beautiful nailhead trim; Button-tufted Craft Backrest; wooden framed; high-resilient foam upholstered which is covered with premium and skin-friendly soft velvet fabric, which has a delicate touch and is tight and durable for easy clean. 👍【Extreme Comfort】Bar stool set filled with a High-density soft sponge cushioned seat and thickened back can relax the body and Provide strong support for comfortable sitting, bringing you extreme comfort. 👍【Stable Structure】High-quality solid birch wood frame ensures structural stability of the counter stools, which provides excellent durability; footrest platform for relaxed sitting posture, facilitate better sitting positions and reduce stress on your knee joints; Anti-slip feet caps ensure balance and avoid floor scratching and tipping over. Weight Capacity: 330 lbs. 👍【Multi-choices】26inch or 30inch barstool set of 2, barstool set of 4 are fully suitable for various occasions, like counters, coffee shops, pubs, home bars, bar Room, kitchen islands, Living Rooms, and Dining Room. 👍【Easy to Assemble and A+ Service】One adult can install stools in 25 minutes. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will provide the best solution within 24 hours. Please Notes: 1. Start assembling under the clear graphic instructions of the manual. 2. Please allow ± 0.1"measurement tolerance. 3. All the pictures are taken by actual samples, slight chromatic aberration may occur due to lighting or display. Package Included: 2 x Bar Stools 1 x Assembly Instruction All tools included', 239.99: