  (5439347407, 'Caroma Electric Scooter for Adult, 30Miles Range&20Mph Power by 20"Off-Road Tire&Height Adjustable Seat, Foldable Scooter E Bike for Mountains, Snow, Road, Black', '【Powerful Motor & Battery】: This electric scooter for adults is equipped with a 500W (peak 819W) powerful brushless hub motor. Top speed up to 20 mph. 48V/500Wh large-capacity lithium battery enables a driving range of 30 miles on one charge. The powerful motor can help you handle a 20° slope with ease. The long-lasting battery ensures a smooth ride to your destination. 【Safety & Comfort】: This adult electric scooter has 20" off-road wide tires combined with an integrated metal body, which is sturdy and durable. Maximum Load Up to 300 lbs. Bright headlight and dual disc brake systems protect your driving at all times. Electrical safety system that automatically cuts off power when braking. Equipped with an ultra-soft shock-absorbing seat to provide you with a safe and comfortable trip. 【Adjustable & Foldable】: The electric scooter handlebar can be folded for easy storage. The seat height is also adjustable, you can adjust it according to your height to achieve the most suitable riding height. This is a great gift for anyone because with the adjustable seat, the receiver doesn''t have to worry about height and can enjoy a super comfortable riding experience. We also have a removable basket as a bonus. 【LCD Display & 3 Speed Modes】: The triangular handlebar makes driving more stable, and the LCD screen clearly shows your real-time riding status, including battery power, current speed, single mileage, total mileage and three adjustable speed modes , low speed (9 mph), medium speed (15 mph), high speed (20 mph). 【Quality Assurance】: P3 Caroma electric scooter is UL 2272 certified. Caroma electric scooter with seat are rigorously tested before shipment. We offer a 12-month warranty on our electric scooters. Our professional customer service is ready to help you with any issues you encounter. Caroma always insists on quality first!', 569.99::numeric, 'Sports & Outdoors', 'Caroma', 4.7::double precision, 618, 100),
